Edit `/tmp/sv-2079232ece3e4a018a46b39d567d5f50/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Layout/NavMenu.razor` to replace Counter and Weather links with Shipments links. View the file first to understand current structure, then replace.

### 13. Create EF Core migration

After making all code changes, from the server project directory run:
```bash
cd /tmp/sv-2079232ece3e4a018a46b39d567d5f50/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker && dotnet ef migrations add AddShipments
```

If `dotnet ef` is not available, install it first:
```bash
dotnet tool install --global dotnet-ef
```

