Fix any compilation errors.

## Important reminders
- The server project must have a project reference to the Client project (the template already sets this up)
- The `Shipment` model lives in the Client project so both projects can reference it
- Don't forget to delete the old `app.db` file if it exists before building so the new migration can create a fresh one (actually, the auto-migration will handle this)
- Make sure the NavMenu links are updated to remove Counter/Weather and add Shipments
